{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-28","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平行六面体与平面与平行线","englishTitle":"If a parallelepipedal solid be cut by a plane through the diagonals of the opposite planes, the solid will be bisected by the plane.","book":11,"number":28,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.28","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.28/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":28,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-28@raw-eb5804f7db517366","contentId":"euclid-11-28","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb5804f7db517366c3a8eecbd80fe2e3985d7acc6748901609886ef65f528d30","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-28.statement","euclid-11-28.construction.1","euclid-11-28.proof.1","euclid-11-28.conclusion","euclid-11-28.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-28.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-28","revisionId":"euclid-11-28@raw-eb5804f7db517366","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07b7b7cff72b76f638de25bcb573f93596e1c4aba1eddd23643469f834ea7013","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a parallelepipedal solid be cut by a plane through the diagonals of the opposite planes, the solid will be bisected by the plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果平行管道的固体通过对面的平面对角线被平面截断,则固体将被平面对齐。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-28.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-28","revisionId":"euclid-11-28@raw-eb5804f7db517366","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6357e2e73d5fec3db9aab34e1d1189a2e6aa4f90d0507cb07afe631f66df0a51","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the parallelepipedal solid AB be cut by the plane CDEF through the diagonals CF, DE of opposite planes; I say that the solid AB will be bisected by the plane CDEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将平行管道AB的固体从平面 CDEF到对角线CF、DE截断;我说,AB的固体将被平面 CDEF分解。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-28.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-28","revisionId":"euclid-11-28@raw-eb5804f7db517366","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bcc5a57bc9d0d91e1a230028a899a3e95545260ab142054f1b85ab3f3aeb0a1","citations":["euclid-1-34","euclid-11-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the triangle CGF is equal to the triangle CFB, [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] and ADE to DEH, while the parallelogram CA is also equal to the parallelogram EB, for they are opposite, and GE to CH, therefore the prism contained by the two triangles CGF, ADE and the three parallelograms GE, AC, CE is also equal to the prism contained by the two triangles CFB, DEH and the three parallelograms CH, BE, CE; for they are contained by planes equal both in multitude and in magnitude. [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为三角CGF等于三角CFB和ADE至DEH,而平行四边形 CA也等于平行四边形 EB,因为它们是对立的,GE至CH,因此,由两个三角CGF、ADE和3 平行四边形 GE、AC、CE组成的棱镜也等于由两个三角CFB、DEH和3 平行四边形 CH、BE、CE组成的棱镜;因为它们由平面组成,在数量和规模上都相等。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-28.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-28","revisionId":"euclid-11-28@raw-eb5804f7db517366","order":3,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5842aab56c52dd7e5445a2ff3191455d8d662390b6e189df94aef7319355eb65","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence the whole solid AB is bisected by the plane CDEF. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,整个AB固体被平面 CDEF、Q D分成两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-28.source","contentId":"euclid-11-28","revisionId":"euclid-11-28@raw-eb5804f7db517366","order":4,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ca80407fd9d1281d4c9843622a6171caf5bbb8a9513adbacdb5ca3df41be610","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.28/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.28\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-28:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-28.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.28/","sourceLabel":"I. 34"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-28:euclid-11-def-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-28.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/read